   "Section"], Cell["As in the PlayGround: a product of two \
representation-valued vectors through the stored CG coefficients (2 \
\\[CircleTimes] 3 = 2 \\[CirclePlus] 2' \\[CirclePlus] 2''), and one target, \
2'', as polynomials of the components.", "Text"], 
  Cell["va = MakeRepVector[GroupTp, 4, {a[1], a[2]}];\nvb = \
MakeRepVector[GroupTp, 7, {b[1], b[2], b[3]}];\n{#[\"TargetLabel\"], \
Simplify[#[\"Components\"]]} & /@ \
VectorComponents[TensorProductVectors[GroupTp, {va, vb}]] // Column", 
   "Input", CellLabel -> "In[14]:="], 
